    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27ce67d6e5605af785d2fb74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "向强者发起挑战的姿态，再次点燃奔跑的热情。\n葛城王牌说出要“一起战斗”，\n并用力地握紧了拳头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7af92d084e5f1c44ad751186840ab450aa66e0520360457c5dd86020839946ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
