    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ac2084231d948eca8f12f94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "椎名弗雷瑞斯因伤而放弃“菊花赏”，\n葛城王牌因为担心她而向对方搭话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db83c9f65a74e474a3da2cb9665b163b5c40c1f69345a151c8ff11d9060509fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:244c8098fe7dfe744b8685bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cf8b8e51f1870fdeadef92d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但椎名弗雷瑞斯却正因此松了一口气。\n再也不会被拿来跟千明代表做比较了，\n再也不需和“另一个世界”的人战斗了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd57ef0d231cd4d5c5663fe2b63581f69e3d8de915b9537df01189e48413d2cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d669ed5ef08aa5f3fc50e4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54d02ce8b6bac3d52f4369d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌原本认为椎名弗雷瑞斯也是\n“另一个世界”的存在，她因此感到惊讶，\n接着意识到每个人眼中都自有“另一个世界”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed5a247c9fbd9d9a4031437f50c0ac1bac70baa12551a3b1895f4c13cdec1aef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8646fe91f6f98e5e84650d15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa11d21d47e62f6cd557c93c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过葛城王牌相信着她。\n相信一路拼命奋斗到至今的她，\n一定能够再次奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6300a789ed32039ee88732fa9043e1ef903ec3cc52a742dc4a5ff3f6bb64c74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d1703cc7b7f8e1f4e88041f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd9cead1c9575e78e0b1af06",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以自己会持续以毫无畏惧的姿态勇往直前，\n她的呼喊声是否能够顺利传达呢？\n经典三冠最后的“菊花赏”即将到来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7e4388b00abae02c2c8b9c9480cdcfdf2273350b715138dc011a35b18105cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adb4be8331211a854cc05685",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一个世界",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb676e655185d3adaa2562d6756256f2dc9a77113ef9ed531f5d69e59223d958",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68f24deee9b5ce7ab71b3660",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在训练员的提议下举办了公开训练。\n活动现场聚集了……邮件的寄件人──\n来自全国各地的葛城王牌粉丝们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03515c16ae6395e69cded4034a88270b522dcebc939f63b2139e76662a8c8a3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2be2bb11ffcf03b69cca333c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有些人说自己获得了面对一切的勇气，\n有些人说自己获得了想战斗的心情。\n她的跑法传达到每个人心里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd6234078cd236a5ef82686d00adae4d958cebe518c3f4af4235cfdabcd02e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cad2db586b1d2adaf8cb160",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表也是其中一人，\n她已经迫不及待地想要比赛，也说葛城王牌正是\n令自己想拿出全力对抗的竞争对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ee1933d688c129b458b406f42743f413ba03083e127385e660ed184efbeb7fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f06055679c906056f3007453",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌已经不再迷惘了。\n她要打破常识和“另一个世界”……\n成为赛马娘界的“王牌”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db403c84c16f502197b81c1fd9fd518fa3aa0cbfec5868e2ea3872327f7f77a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5be599c51e5d550cfb2e5ba5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "直冲天际，燃起火焰",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c3d20b036cf9cdc839499a6f343d53446ece7559a1e4fea53f73ca96c5bdf04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67953693af2f4d166fcdab56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104406.json",
      "json_path": [
