    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d4e7c2c175103f3d3a5fcd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌觉得自己也不能输人，\n因而鼓起干劲。\n各自的夏季集训就此展开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4629663b53c647c97eef7049527f552a3c0735ea7a6dca1f716394274d73ce62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69a18f616307a203944aada3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fa88913ac864b794ca37491",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌流露出一丝焦躁感。\n就算获胜，世人的看法也不会改变。\n这种想法将她自己逼到了绝境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c506c40b045159e4ccedc09e01f32b3db9b6f94c31bd8ddd8bb207e20c08b4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
