    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96846d064f15c6779087bbc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员想到了一个方法\n来消除葛城王牌内心的焦虑。\n就在这时，夏季集训开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bfca2dac4bf63658a99d8a8e9d6a6d3f5cc1448fb49a3bda008c1ba38f50453",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
