      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是成为赛马娘界“王牌”的第一步。\n葛城王牌的出道战就此开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b659d1e01c4c534724f9e737877d7ed2391edf9ac327b5d1211ef71f1ab04ab5",
