      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要跑出让千明代表认可的强悍跑法。\n抱持着这样的想法，\n葛城王牌发起了挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a16a3b395f535ee064c5f7d9b280fd21037a07af9e677b2fbb1a8ee8c3f1e02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
