      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠的首战“皋月赏”。\n对战对手是来自名门的赛马娘，\n椎名弗雷瑞斯，以及──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1ddbac7afded24cbe64e7d0213d191a7c336539e2d0a121fdd91c0a23d0e127",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
