    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dd696463b5b8fbb46641220",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光是现身就让周围感受到压力的千明代表。\n观众们抱持着期待，\n希望她成为三冠赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1fb8460d2f740b855e7d1b36e3c08dcd6e671ed6e97acdb5a097af6a2ac94d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
