    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e958e3dcfc3d3c0e2a64754",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表在“皋月赏”时的跑姿，\n一直在葛城王牌的脑海里挥之不去。\n对着这样的她，训练员这么说道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08f0165266a828d0e75eba96f9913395ae2ba77d42df1593da1f0dd59a66fc24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebd593a8eab0c53fa2236749",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在葛城王牌已站上被称为\n“另一个世界”的最顶尖比赛之中。\n希望她能相信让自己走到这一步的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae79489a513271bc0e37b90763a5331ecdb000f3e16c51a6966d22ab784fa7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6148951a800e3071378d6d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员的这些话，\n让葛城王牌鼓起了干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34bcaaf8de39faea8d0595bed2c35cd63f52cc814a73ec3d9d9cbd4e5f6a27bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104411.json",
      "json_path": [
