      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谁是中距离最强选手？\n为了证明这一点，并展现存在感。\n此刻，参加“宝冢纪念”吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aed840d9e6d63cf8610a4b5f8e7c58ef035ad66eec2e1004b5c44faa514a20f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
