    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d80d12b13aaaab65adb678",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”，人们期待\n休养后复出的千明代表能够获得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8fd5bdfb0bfdd6df23f60294c7d189744d0676f286e141e79d2a15e0fc8b995",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104415.json",
